rce. Re-verified the same day against the publisher-deposited full text re-fetched in session (Europe PMC PMC7883933, HTTP 200), not against this note: journal Methods (San Diego, Calif.), 2021, volume 185, fpage 120, DOI 10.1016/j.ymeth.2020.01.011 all match. Each clause of the restored sentence was matched to its support: "credibility" appears 51 times and the keywords include Model credibility; "model verification and sensitivity analysis are also required" under the FDA and EMA PBPK guidelines; "Applicability refers to the range for the model input parameters that characterize or BOUND the validation activities", which is where "bounded domain of applicability" comes from; and "there is no validation in the absence of comparator data". The citation closes the attributed span, with "which this work does not perform" left outside it as our own clause.}
